      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772527282889,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Node tests (rules).\n\nfiles:\ntest_calculate_log_node.py,\ntest_food_search_node.py,\ntest_stats_node.py,\ntest_multi_item_loop.py\ntest_feedback_logic.py.\n\n\nIn these files, we are only\ntesting the states in the graph\nof the node being tested.\n\nLLM is being mocked, as is the\ntool (which creates the\nconnection to the DB).",
      "fontSize": 19.828571428571433,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Node tests (rules).\n\nfiles:\ntest_calculate_log_node.py, test_food_search_node.py, test_stats_node.py, test_multi_item_loop.py  test_feedback_logic.py.\n\n\nIn these files, we are only testing the states in the graph of the node being tested.\n\nLLM is being mocked, as is the tool (which creates the connection to the DB).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
